{"title": "Rays of Fire (Cantrip)", "pageid": 32182, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Rays_of_Fire_(Cantrip)", "categories": ["Spells", "Cantrips", "Actions", "Sources of Fire damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the Rays of Fire spell used by enemies and Cambion (Planar Ally) see <a href=\"/wiki/Rays_of_Fire\" title=\"Rays of Fire\">Rays of Fire</a></div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Rays_of_Fire.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Rays_of_Fire.webp/300px-Rays_of_Fire.webp, /w/images/5/5b/Rays_of_Fire.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Rays_of_Fire.webp/300px-Rays_of_Fire.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Rays_of_Fire.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Rays of Fire</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">cantrip</a>. This spell allows spellcasters to hurl 3 rays of fire at targets within range. The rays can all target the same creature, or they can be dispersed to different targets.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nHurl 3 rays of fire. Each ray deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">3d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 9~54</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:42px;height:30px;margin-left:12px;padding-top:9px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:2;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/27px-D6_Fire.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/40px-D6_Fire.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/54px-D6_Fire.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/27px-D6_Fire.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/im